 playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700580/extras/e515f40529975ee1a9ba43c4c43247ee.poster.avif?t=1772738975\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700580/extras/e515f40529975ee1a9ba43c4c43247ee.webm?t=1772738975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700580/extras/e515f40529975ee1a9ba43c4c43247ee.mp4?t=1772738975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Livber: Smoke and Mirrors</i> is a text-based interactive fiction game in the <i>choose your own adventure</i> tradition. Your choices don’t just influence your next move; they reshape the entire narrative. The doors you open, the questions you choose to ask, or the silence you choose to keep, can all lead you to different paths, different fates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you’re pulled through these dark halls by Lilith’s obsessions, no choice is right or wrong. Every decision alters how the story unfolds. And in the end, when the sins you tried to bury rise through the soil, all that remains is who you’ve become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At every step, one question will haunt you:<br>&quot;Who do you become when the one you love is gone?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 60,000 words, <i>Livber: Smoke and Mirrors</i> is a dark psychological thriller about how love can decay, how longing can twist into obsession, and how sometimes, to love is to destroy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700580/extras/2e8f7dabf745497e31a387dbcc57863d.avif?t=1772738975\" width=616 height=78 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREDITS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ink-stained shadow's allegory, Int