        "short_description": "A short psychological horror interactive story. Five years after vanishing without a trace, the woman you once called your lover writes from beyond the silence: &quot;I will give birth to our creation.” In three acts, descend into a fractured mindscape where obsession, memory, and myth intertwine.",
        "supported_languages": "English, Turkish, German",
